      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OZZIE DIAMOND (10) is really delivering now, recording back-to-back wins at this circuit and distance. Worked forward to lead then gave her opponents no chance when she cruised to a 12 metre victory last week. Draws on the back row this time but she is going well enough to overcome it. KNOW THE SCORE (1) is close to a win. Finished second from the back row last start at Ballarat, beaten less than 2 metres, after also filling a minor placing at the previous appearance at Shepparton. The ace draw gives him every chance to break through. GLENLINE (2) draws well and comes right into contention after coming from the back row to score last start by 11 metres at Ballarat. The lone career win of STERLING GIGI (7) came at this venue and he is in the mix following a respectable third at his most recent appearance at Cranbourne.",
